stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Stopped

    Stopped --> Armed: link activated / vpn.connected
    Armed --> Starting: vpn.ip_ready OR manual_start
    Starting --> Running: extender thread up
    Running --> Running: MavExtenderStatusEvent
    Running --> Stopping: link deactivated / vpn.disconnected
    Stopping --> Stopped: thread joined

    Running: UDP client bound to tunnel IP
    Running: forwards to mav_primary router
